{
  "$schema": "https://xnsteam-ai.github.io/Html-library/r/schema.json",
  "name": "message-list",
  "title": "Message List",
  "description": "A conversation thread with user bubbles, assistant turns, hover actions, and a streaming turn with a caret.",
  "category": "agent",
  "type": "html",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "tailwind": "^4.0.0",
  "tags": [
    "messages",
    "thread",
    "streaming"
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "message-list.html",
      "type": "html",
      "content": "<!--\n  Message List — a conversation thread with working feedback controls.\n  Each assistant turn has an exclusive thumbs-up/down radio pair that stays\n  selected once clicked. No JavaScript.\n-->\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl space-y-5\">\n  <div class=\"flex justify-end\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md bg-gray-100 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-gray-100\">\n      Summarize what changed in the auth module this week.\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"flex gap-3\">\n    <span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/15\">\n      <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 text-foreground dark:text-gray-100\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 1.5l1.6 8.9 6.3-4.8-4.8 6.3 8.9 1.6-8.9 1.6 4.8 6.3-6.3-4.8-1.6 8.9-1.6-8.9-6.3 4.8 4.8-6.3L-.5 13.5l8.9-1.6-4.8-6.3 6.3 4.8z\" /></svg>\n    </span>\n    <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 space-y-2\">\n      <p class=\"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground dark:text-gray-200\">\n        Three things landed: session rotation moved server-side, the magic-link TTL dropped to 10 minutes, and the legacy cookie fallback was removed.\n      </p>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md p-1.5 text-muted-foreground transition hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-gray-200\" aria-label=\"Copy response\">\n          <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\" /><path d=\"M5 15V5a2 2 0 012-2h10\" /></svg>\n        </button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md p-1.5 text-muted-foreground transition hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-muted-foreground dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:hover:text-gray-200\" aria-label=\"Retry\">\n          <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 11-3-6.7M21 4v5h-5\" /></svg>\n        </button>\n        <label class=\"cursor-pointer\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"message-list-feedback-1\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n          <span class=\"flex rounded-md p-1.5 text-muted-foreground transition hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-muted-foreground peer-checked:bg-emerald-50 peer-checked:text-emerald-600 dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:peer-checked:bg-emerald-500/15 dark:peer-checked:text-emerald-400\" aria-label=\"Good response\">\n            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 11v9H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-7a1 1 0 011-1h3zm0 0l4.5-8a2 2 0 013.7 1.3L14.5 8H19a2 2 0 012 2.3l-1.2 7A2 2 0 0117.8 19H7\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n        </label>\n        <label class=\"cursor-pointer\">\n          <input type=\"radio\" name=\"message-list-feedback-1\" class=\"peer sr-only\" />\n          <span class=\"flex rounded-md p-1.5 text-muted-foreground transition hover:bg-gray-100 hover:text-muted-foreground peer-checked:bg-red-50 peer-checked:text-red-600 dark:hover:bg-white/10 dark:peer-checked:bg-red-500/15 dark:peer-checked:text-red-400\" aria-label=\"Bad response\">\n            <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M17 13V4h3a1 1 0 011 1v7a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3zm0 0l-4.5 8a2 2 0 01-3.7-1.3L9.5 16H5a2 2 0 01-2-2.3l1.2-7A2 2 0 016.2 5H17\" /></svg>\n          </span>\n        </label>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"flex justify-end\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-[85%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-md bg-gray-100 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground dark:bg-white/10 dark:text-gray-100\">\n      Which of those is a breaking change for the mobile client?\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Streaming turn -->\n  <div class=\"flex gap-3\">\n    <span class=\"mt-0.5 flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-gray-200 dark:border-white/15\">\n      <svg class=\"h-3.5 w-3.5 animate-pulse text-foreground dark:text-gray-100\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M12 1.5l1.6 8.9 6.3-4.8-4.8 6.3 8.9 1.6-8.9 1.6 4.8 6.3-6.3-4.8-1.6 8.9-1.6-8.9-6.3 4.8 4.8-6.3L-.5 13.5l8.9-1.6-4.8-6.3 6.3 4.8z\" /></svg>\n    </span>\n    <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\">\n      <p class=\"text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-foreground dark:text-gray-200\">\n        Only the cookie fallback removal — the mobile client still sends<span class=\"mx-1 inline-block h-3.5 w-2 translate-y-0.5 animate-pulse bg-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-100\"></span>\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
    }
  ]
}
